<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I consecrate myself</l><l>To give You the first place,</l><l>First love, and only love.</l><l>To all else, You’re above.</l><l>To all else, You’re above.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Preeminence, I give.</l><l>Do reign supreme in me,</l><l>In my entire being.</l><l>You are my Lord, my King.</l><l>You are my Lord, my King.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>There’s nothing I hold back.</l><l>No room in me I close,</l><l>But have the way in me.</l><l>All freedom’s giv’n to Thee.</l><l>All freedom’s giv’n to Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Though I don’t know my future,</l><l>I trust in Your wise hands,</l><l>Your sovereignty, Your ways;</l><l>I’ll love You, Lord, always.</l><l>I’ll love You, Lord, always.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
